hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"607","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hujron mein se ek hujre mein se jhanka; jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hath mein lohe ki kanghi [midra] thi jis se Aap Apna sar khujate the. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar main janta ke tum dekh rahe ho to main is se tumhari aankh phod deta. Ijazat sirf nazar ki wajah se rakhi gayi hai.'"
"608","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar koi tum par baghair ijazat jhanke phir tum use [kankari] maro aur us ki aankh phod do to tum par koi gunah nahin.'"
"609","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Apne ghar mein the; ek aadmi ne Aap par jhanka. To Aap us ki taraf teer ke phal [mishqas] se jhuke jo Aap ke hath mein tha, goya agar woh peeche na hatta to Aap us se use chhedne ki parwah na farmate."
"610","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke jab Aap logon ke darmiyan baithe the, achanak ek aadmi aaya aur Aap se sargoshi ki; ham nahin jante us ne kya sargoshi ki yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne buland aawaz farmai. To pata chala ke woh Aap se munafiqon mein se ek aadmi ke qatl ki ijazat mang raha tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab buland farmaya to farmaya: 'Kya woh gawahi nahin deta ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain?' Us aadmi ne kaha: Kyun nahin Ya Rasulullah, lekin us ke liye koi gawahi nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya woh namaz nahin padhta?' Us ne kaha: Kyun nahin, lekin us ke liye koi namaz nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yahi woh hain jin se mujhe Allah Azz wa Jall ne mana farmaya hai [un ke qatl se].'"
"611","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main logon se ladta rahunga yahan tak ke woh kahen: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin. Phir jab woh kahen: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye siwae us ke haq ke; aur un ka hisab Allah Azz wa Jall par hai.'"
